WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.856 --> 00:00:07.572
Tap the microphone and say a measurement.

2
00:00:08.072 --> 00:00:13.777
The app shows what it heard and what it did.

3
00:00:14.277 --> 00:00:19.982
Say "window on wall 2, width one metre twenty".

4
00:00:20.482 --> 00:00:26.189
Say "ceiling height two metres sixty".

5
00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:32.400
Misheard something? Say "Undo".

6
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.867
In this video the speech recognition is simulated.

